  "releaseNotes": "## v8.0.0 Major feature release\n\n### Bird view\n\n- 10, 11 is now supported, interim .net versions dropped, keep supporting net472 and netstandard2.1\n- Depending on DryIoc v6 and all its goodies\n- Better performance and less memory allocations\n\n### Features\n\n- #618 Multiple same service key support mostly for DryIoc.MS.DI though it is already supported in DryIoc.MefAttributedModel\n\n### Fixes\n\n- #710 ConstructorWithResolvableArguments conflicts with MEF (v6)\n- #663 DryIocAttributes and DryIoc.MefAttributedModel are not nullable friendly",
